# Index homing a second time (webui/mill/bench, 2026-10-23): after one
# index homing the joint stops past the index (fb_abs quadrant 1); standing
# at fb_abs -0.63 (quadrant 4) the next request saw idx_home's lastq from
# the request before, took 1 -> 4 for the index and reported it at once:
# the joint was "homed" where it stood, without moving. It must wait for
# the index (index_rehome_creep.test: creeping on finds it).
@args --drive ../hwtest/burnin/ECMA-C30604FS/stmbl.conf
@timeout 120
lcnc 0 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1 0
run 1.5
lcnc 1 20
run 0.5
lcncindex 1
run 2.5
lcnc 1 0
run 0.5
idx_home0.fb_abs
# home again standing still: no index
lcncindex 1
run 0.5
lcncindex
@expect idx_home0.fb_abs < -0.1
@expect lcncindex.found == 0
@expect lcncindex.periods >= 500
